\\# Macro @a: Verifies that the current buffer is a valid vco file
\\#
\\# Failures:
\\#   - Current buffer is not a valid vco file
\\#
\\# Effects:
\\#   - Sets @z to invalid vco file error message
\\#   - Sets @h for exception handling to called after the entry macro
\\# 
\\# Notes:
\\# Exits early using a failed motions if the file isn't a valid object file 
\\# with @h = "ZQ.." to be called after the entry macro of the call stack. @h
\\# will be a no-op if the file was valid.
